{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112142","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112142/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112142/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112142/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112142","id":3564112114,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6wRpzv","number":112142,"title":"X11: Fix minimize/maximize buttons can't be hidden","user":{"login":"timothyqiu","id":372476,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjQ3Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/372476?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu","html_url":"https://github.com/timothyqiu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097326,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTczMjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:linuxbsd","name":"platform:linuxbsd","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-10-29T02:50:17Z","updated_at":"2025-11-04T23:28:40Z","closed_at":"2025-11-04T22:37:41Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112142","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112142","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112142.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112142.patch","merged_at":"2025-11-04T22:37:41Z"},"body":"Currently, neither `minimize_disabled` nor `maximize_disabled` works on X11.\r\n\r\nThe feature was implemented by setting the `_NET_WM_ALLOWED_ACTIONS` property. But the property is not for requesting changes, it's a list of supportted actions that the window manager provides.\r\n\r\n> A list of atoms indicating user operations that the Window Manager supports for this window.[^1]\r\n\r\nThis PR:\r\n\r\n- Implements `minimize_disabled` and `maximize_disabled` via the `_MOTIF_WM_HINTS` property.\r\n- When getting the `borderless` property, return `wd.borderless` instead of reading from `_MOTIF_WM_HINTS`.\r\n  - `_MOTIF_WM_HINTS` is for clients to request certain attributes, window managers don't write to it.\r\n  - This keeps the behavior consistent with other flags.\r\n- Removes the manual borderless changes when toggling fullscreen. It's redundant since window managers that support `_NET_WM_STATE_FULLSCREEN` do that automatically.\r\n\r\nAs it is not a standardized property, different window managers often handle `_MOTIF_WM_HINTS` differently. Some only read it before displaying the window, some only support certain combinations, and some ignore it entirely.\r\n\r\nI tested on xfwm4, metacity, fluxbox, and kwin_x11.\r\n\r\n- xfwm4: Modifications to the flags take effect at any time and can be any combination.\r\n- metacity: Can be any combination. Modifications made after the window appears may sometimes cause rendering issues.\r\n- fluxbox: Can be any combination. Modifications only take effect before the window appears.\r\n- kwin_x11: Not supported on purpose :( [^2] The maximize button is only hidden when resize is disabled.\r\n\r\n[^1]:https://specifications.freedesktop.org/wm-spec/latest-single/#id-1.6.9\r\n[^2]:https://github.com/KDE/kwin/blob/b8e6b119ab15ff8e7b182f8b60b7fca9d71f8ec7/src/x11window.cpp#L1763-L1764","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112142/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112142/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}